  "name": "Cheese-Stuffed Garlic Dough Balls with Tomato Dip",
  "subtitle": "Golden, cheese-filled dough bites with a warm basil tomato dip",
  "description": "Soft dough balls wrapped around mozzarella, baked with garlic butter and rosemary, and served with a quick tomato dipping sauce.",
